# Docker build context for deploy/runpod/Dockerfile (built from the repo root). Allowlist: only what the image
# copies goes in, so backend/.env, private/, data/, samples/sessions/, training/ and ios/ never reach a
# builder or a registry.
*
!backend/repairos
!config
!spec/contracts
!samples/session.schema.json
!tools/requeue_scan.py
!deploy/runpod
!deploy/smoke.sh
!deploy/smoke-still.jpg
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/*.env
**/.DS_Store
